OL,3,GNEWSAAnimal artwork commemorates town's
OL,4,Along lost zoo
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new mural has been painted to mark
OL,7,Fthe time a town in Derbyshire was home
OL,8,Fto monkeys, lemurs and even a bear
OL,9,Fnamed Little Roosevelt.
OL,11,FRipley once had a zoo operated for
OL,12,Fseven years by entrepreneur John
OL,13,FMarshall until it was forced to close
OL,14,Fwhen the outbreak of World War One made
OL,15,Fit "impossible" to get food for the
OL,16,Fanimals.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
