OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAAnimal artwork commemorates town's
OL,4,Along lost zoo
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtist Amy Vallance and Arts Award
OL,7,FBronze pupils from St John's Primary
OL,8,FSchool in Ripley used collage
OL,9,Ftechniques to create an artwork
OL,10,Finspired by the animals, in the style
OL,11,Fof French artist Henri Matisse.
OL,13,FThe creation was then painted on to
OL,14,FRipley Town Hall by Vallance and fellow
OL,15,Fartist Grace Calloway over four days.
